# Base URL of the GateSense API.
#
# Local dev: leave unset — the app falls back to http://localhost:8000 (see
# src/api.js). Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to the browser.
#
# Production (Vercel): set this to the Railway backend URL, with no trailing
# slash. The WebSocket URL is derived from it (https -> wss), so it must be
# https in production or the socket will be blocked as mixed content.
#
# The backend must also allow this site's origin via its CORS_ORIGINS.
# VITE_API_URL=https://gatesense-backend.up.railway.app
